# Documentation: markdown (README.md, docs/, CLAUDE.md) is tracked by default.
# Do NOT blanket-ignore *.md and re-allow with `!` negations — many copy/export
# tools that honor .gitignore drop the ignored files but skip the `!` rules,
# silently leaving README.md & docs out of the copy. Ignore specific scratch
# markdown by name instead, e.g.:  /REVIEW.md
pg_plan3.txt

# Archived migration scripts and docs
postgres/migrations/ARCHIVE/
docs/ARCHIVE/

